# Frontend (Next.js 15)

- App Router, React 19, TypeScript 5 (strict), Tailwind 4, shadcn/ui (Radix).
- Server data: TanStack Query. Ephemeral UI state: Zustand. No Redux.
- Talk only to `/api/v1/*`. Types should match backend Pydantic models; do not silently rename fields.

## Chat (primary screen)

- Split pane: chat **~45%** left, PDF viewer **~55%** right.
- Citations in the answer are interactive tags, e.g. `Expense_Policy.pdf (p. 4)`.
- Clicking a citation **must**: open that file in the viewer, jump to `page`, and highlight the snippet when coordinates/text exist.
- Reuse ChainWise `streamContractChat` parser. SSE order: `citations` → `token` → `meta`/`done`. Click citation → `Doc.pdf` page, not `file.sol` lines.

## Knowledge base admin

- Table: title, size, pages, access tags, status (`pending|processing|ready|failed`).
- Drag-and-drop upload modal with `access_roles` (`HR`, `Finance`, `General`, …).
- Poll `GET /documents/{id}/status` until `ready` or `failed`.
- PDF bytes come from `GET /documents/{id}/raw` (auth + ACL). Never use a public bucket URL.

Accessibility: keyboard-focusable citations, readable contrast on highlights. Prefer existing shadcn primitives over custom CSS.
